---
// What kay/markdown makes of `- [ ] a`, `- [x] b` and `- c`, in the reading view of an app.
---
.kui-prose#prose
  ul
    li.task-list-item#open
      label
        input.task-list-item-checkbox(type="checkbox" disabled)
        | Open
    li.task-list-item#done
      label
        input.task-list-item-checkbox(type="checkbox" disabled checked)
        | Done
    li#plain Plain
  span.bg-accent#accent
